  "description": "<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Tired of dry flaky skin?&nbsp; Ready for your make-up to glide on smoothly?&nbsp; Wish you could upgrade your skincare routine without adding time and steps?<br></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">We've got your back.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">At The Exfoliation Shop, we believe radiant, healthy skin starts with thoughtful care. That&rsquo;s why we offer carefully curated and custom-crafted tools and products designed to exfoliate, restore, and rejuvenate your face&nbsp;<em>and</em> body. We know life gets busy, which is why our eco-friendly tools and clean-label formulas are made to elevate your self-care routine without adding complexity or extra time.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Two of our best-selling items are our proprietary silicone face brush and lip exfoliating brush. These innovative tools seamlessly pair with your existing skincare routine to gently remove dead skin cells, stimulate blood flow, and reveal brighter, smoother skin.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Our collection also includes cold-process cleansing bars, an ancient ramie fiber body cloth, an agave fiber soap bag, and a natural fiber wooden dry brush to name a few. With a continually expanding product line and proven, effective staples, The Exfoliation Shop is here to simplify self-care while helping you achieve your healthiest, most radiant skin.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">As a brand affiliate you will have access to discounted products, and a starting commission of 10%.&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Have questions?&nbsp; Shoot us an e-mail at hello {@} theexfoliationshop.com</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"></span></div>\r\n</div>",
